  {
    "screen": "proxyclean-ipv6-routing-control-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "在 ProxyClean 的“维护工具”窗口先查看 IPv6 绑定与路由，再明确点开启或关闭；需要整组切换时用命令行 IPv6-Toggle.ps1 -Mode Toggle。"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **先只读看当前路径**　列出所有在线网卡的 IPv6 开关与路线，并标明哪些是物理网卡；配置存在不等于浏览器一定从这条路上网。",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
